{
  "name": "Midnight",
  "base": "dark",
  "notes": [
    "A built-in theme. Every token in the contract is set, because a built-in is",
    "what an incomplete theme falls back to.",
    "Values are #rgb, #rrggbb, #rrggbbaa, rgb(), rgba(), hsl(), hsla(), or the",
    "keyword transparent. Nothing else."
  ],
